{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_8_level_main_08-15_end","groupId":"main_8","stageId":"main_08-15","title":"恨火，流向原野","storyCode":"JT8-1","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_08-15_end.txt","sourceHash":"ca02739a39cc23916867b88fd20ef463094ddc9672315a88262ddef313abb27e","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"当恨意无法抑制，当恶行汹涌肆虐，自诩正义的勇士不得不面对凄厉的真相。她融化在自己背负的阴影中，事实吞噬了她的意志。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutry_3"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯农民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯农民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"火！火！烫啊啊啊！！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯农民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"救命！！！！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_8_11"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"爸爸！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哨兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"怎么回事！快走，快跑啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"儿子，我的儿子！你这畜生......感染的牲口！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊！！火太大了，火太大了！咳，咳，唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"混蛋！！！我死也不会......我诅咒你！！我诅咒你！！！皇帝在上，惩罚这些该死的感染者吧！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊......啊......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"narration","text":"已经不能再回头了。\n至此，这里发生的事，除了塔露拉外，无人知晓。\n之后的事情，众所皆知。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_top"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿米娅睁开眼睛。\n她的眼泪还没干。但她已经看过了一切。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么这里会有只卡特斯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅！！当心！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_010_chen","aliases":["陈"]},{"speakerId":"char_011_talula","aliases":["塔露拉"]}]}
